# Cursor Rules for Bhuwanta Repository

# ⛔ CRITICAL RULE: NEVER WORK OR COMMIT ON MAIN
- You are strictly forbidden from modifying files or running `git commit` directly on `main` or `master`.
- Before making any code modifications or running commands that mutate code, always check current branch with `git branch --show-current`.
- If on `main`, immediately instruct the user or run: `git checkout -b feature/<name>` or `git checkout -b hotfix/<name>`.
- Always run `npm test` and `npx tsc --noEmit` to verify correctness.
- Full details in AGENTS.md.
